# Downloaded dependencies. The component manager owns this directory: it fetches
# the exact versions pinned in dependencies.lock and writes a .component_hash it
# then verifies. Committing the result put 104 MB of other people's source in
# the repo AND broke every build on a machine whose IDF resolved differently —
# the manager saw content it had not written and refused to continue.
#
# dependencies.lock stays tracked. That file is the pin; this directory is what
# the pin produces.
managed_components/
